 TO PLAY A TUNE ON THE PDP8 MUSIC PROGRAM, ASK OS8 TO RUN (R)

THE SELECTION OF YOUR CHOICE. THE SELECTIONS ARE ALL CALLED MUSCN

WHERE N IS A DECIMAL NUMBER BETWEEN 1 AND 99.

EXAMPLE:       R MUSC2      FOLLOWED BY CARRIAGE RETURN

WILL PLAY  "BABY ELEPHANT WALK".

 MUSIC AVAILABLE AT THE TIME OF CREATING THIS HELP FILE WAS:


MUSC1     A SHORT CLASSICAL PIECE!
MUSC2     BABY ELEPHANT WALK
MUSC3     B MINOR MINUET
MUSC4     LA MER
MUSC5     ONE OF BEETHOVEN'S PIANO SONATAS
MUSC6     SOME LATIN AMERICAN IMPRESSIONS
MUSC7     PRELUDE TO BACH GOES TO TOWN
MUSC8     BACH GOES TO TOWN
MUSC9     THE ENTERTAINER
MUSC10    AMERICA THE BEAUTIFUL
MUSC11    MINUET IN G


 START THE PROGRAMS WITH THE SWITCH REGISTER=0000

 SR00 A ONE PLAYS OR REPEATS THE TUNE

TO RETURN TO OS8 TO MAKE ANOTHER SELECTION, FIRST HALT THE
MUSIC PROGRAM WITH SING STEP OR HALT SWITCH, AND THEN LOAD
ADDRESS 7605 AND CLEAR, CONTINUE.

       HOPE YOU ENJOY AND PROFIT FROM YOUR MEETING,


